; One variable: a SpotLight3D that casts a shadow but sits outside the view, so the cull hands it no
; atlas slot and no positional shadow draws this frame. Every lit surface still samples the atlas, so
; the atlas must exist before the first slot is drawn. Every other shadowed light is in view.

